#: src/ctlpanel.c:359
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "テーマ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:360
msgid "Look"
msgstr "外観"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:361
msgid "Colour preset for window chrome and synui's own panels"
msgstr "ウィンドウの枠と synui 自身のパネルの配色プリセット"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:362
msgid "Wallpaper"
msgstr "壁紙"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:368
msgid "Wallpaper accent"
msgstr "壁紙からアクセント色"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:371
msgid ""
"Take the accent off the wallpaper instead of the theme. Auto is Prism (light "
"or dark), which is built on it, and nothing else"
msgstr ""
"アクセント色をテーマではなく壁紙から取ります。自動はそれを土台にした Prism "
"(明るい／暗い) で、それ以外にはなりません"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:386
msgid "RGB lights"
msgstr "RGB ライト"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:388
msgid "Put the wallpaper's accent on RGB hardware (needs openrgb)"
msgstr "壁紙のアクセント色を RGB 機器に出します (openrgb が必要)"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:389
msgid "Cursor theme"
msgstr "カーソルテーマ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:391
msgid "UI font"
msgstr "UI のフォント"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:392
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文字"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:393
msgid "The family every synui panel draws in. Previews live; Esc puts it back"
msgstr "synui のパネルが描くフォント。プレビューは即時、Esc で元に戻ります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:406
msgid "Font size"
msgstr "フォントサイズ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:409
msgid "Applications: GTK, Qt and the terminal. Applies when you stop"
msgstr "アプリケーション: GTK、Qt、端末。手を止めた時点で適用されます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:410
msgid "Text scale"
msgstr "文字の拡大率"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:413
msgid "The bar and the SYNAPSE apps — Files, Settings, Disks, Software"
msgstr "バーと SYNAPSE のアプリ — ファイル、設定、ディスク、ソフトウェア"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:415
msgid "Transparency"
msgstr "透明度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:416 src/ctlpanel.c:428
msgid "Glass"
msgstr "ガラス"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:417
msgid "Focused-window opacity. Left/Right adjust; Enter switches it off"
msgstr "選択中のウィンドウの不透明度。左右で調整、Enter で切ります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:437
msgid ""
"Auto follows the theme · Off is never glass · or set how much you see through"
msgstr "自動はテーマに従い、オフは常に不透明、または透け具合を指定します"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:443
msgid "Sync all glass"
msgstr "ガラスを揃える"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:446
msgid ""
"Every surface follows Glass above. Change one and it keeps its own until you "
"switch this back on"
msgstr ""
"すべての面が上のガラスに従います。個別に変えるとその面は自分の値を保ち、これ"
"を入れ直すまで続きます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:448
msgid "Legibility correction"
msgstr "可読性の補正"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:451
msgid ""
"Surfaces go less see-through where their text would not read. Off draws "
"exactly what you asked for"
msgstr ""
"文字が読みにくくなる場所では面の透けを弱めます。オフは指定どおりに描きます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:467
msgid "Live backdrop"
msgstr "背景を実際に映す"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:470
msgid ""
"Menus and panels ink themselves off the window behind them rather than the "
"wallpaper it covers. Lands within a second"
msgstr ""
"メニューやパネルは、覆っている壁紙ではなく背後のウィンドウから色を取ります。"
"1 秒ほどで反映されます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:472
msgid "Unfocused opacity"
msgstr "非選択時の不透明度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:475
msgid "How far windows you are not using fade back"
msgstr "使っていないウィンドウをどこまで後退させるか"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:476
msgid "Terminal glass"
msgstr "端末のガラス"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:479
msgid "foot draws its own background alpha, so it needs its own level"
msgstr "foot は自分で背景の透過を描くため、専用の値が要ります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:489
msgid "Make it all solid"
msgstr "すべて不透明にする"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:490
msgid "Glass off and windows opaque, in one press. The rows above put it back"
msgstr "ガラスを切りウィンドウを不透明に、ひと押しで。上の各行で戻せます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:509
msgid "Make it all clear"
msgstr "すべて透明にする"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:510
msgid ""
"Bar, dock and menus lose their background entirely, inked off the wallpaper. "
"The rows above put it back"
msgstr ""
"バー、ドック、メニューの背景を完全になくし、壁紙から色を取ります。上の各行で"
"戻せます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:513 src/ctlpanel.c:514
msgid "CRT effects"
msgstr "CRT 効果"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:515
msgid "The GLES post-process pass. Off on renderers that have none"
msgstr "GLES の後処理。持たないレンダラーではオフになります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:516
msgid "All filters"
msgstr "すべてのフィルター"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:517 src/filters.c:85
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "走査線"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:520
msgid "Screen curve"
msgstr "画面の湾曲"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:523 src/filters.c:87
msgid "Chromatic aberration"
msgstr "色収差"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:526
msgid "Glitch on alert"
msgstr "警告時のグリッチ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:530
msgid "Phosphor tint"
msgstr "蛍光体の色"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:531 src/filters.c:89
msgid "Phosphor"
msgstr "蛍光体"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:534
msgid "Off leaves the picture in colour; the blend below is what applies it"
msgstr "オフのままなら画面は色付き、下の混ぜ具合で初めて適用されます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:535
msgid "Phosphor blend"
msgstr "蛍光体の混ぜ具合"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:538
msgid "Blend toward the phosphor tint. Bloom only bites once this is up"
msgstr "蛍光体の色へ寄せます。ブルームはこれを上げてから効きます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:539
msgid "Phosphor glow"
msgstr "蛍光体の輝き"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:542 src/filters.c:92
msgid "Phosphor lift"
msgstr "蛍光体の下地"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:545
msgid "How far the unlit field glows: 0 keeps it black, up lights the raster"
msgstr ""
"光っていない面がどれだけ光るか: 0 は黒のまま、上げると走査面が明るくなります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:546 src/filters.c:93
msgid "Phosphor hue"
msgstr "蛍光体の色相"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:549
msgid ""
"Turns the tint's colour: down is redder (amber to orange), up yellower. 0.50 "
"is the preset"
msgstr ""
"色味を回します: 下げると赤寄り (琥珀から橙)、上げると黄寄り。0.50 が既定です"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:557
msgid "Titlebars"
msgstr "タイトルバー"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:558
msgid "Frame"
msgstr "枠"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:559
msgid "Server-side titlebars, on every window at once"
msgstr "サーバー側のタイトルバーを全ウィンドウに一括で"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:560
msgid "Titlebar height"
msgstr "タイトルバーの高さ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:563
msgid "0 removes the titlebar; below 14 there is no room for a button"
msgstr "0 でタイトルバーは消え、14 未満ではボタンの場所がありません"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:564
msgid "Border width"
msgstr "枠線の太さ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:567
msgid "Corner radius"
msgstr "角の丸み"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:570
msgid "Forced square while maximized, so nothing pokes past the output"
msgstr "最大化中は必ず四角: 画面の外へはみ出させないためです"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:572
msgid "Tiling gap"
msgstr "タイル間の余白"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:573 src/ctlpanel.c:747
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "配置"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:576
msgid "Master area"
msgstr "メインの領域"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:579
msgid "Share of the screen the master window takes when tiling"
msgstr "タイル配置でメインのウィンドウが取る画面の割合"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:580
msgid "Cascade pile size"
msgstr "カスケードの重ね数"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:584
msgid "How deep a cascade pile may get once the grid of piles is full"
msgstr "重ねの格子が埋まったあと、ひと山をどこまで深く積めるか"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:586
msgid "Drop shadow"
msgstr "ドロップシャドウ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:587
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "影"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:590
msgid "Shadow softness"
msgstr "影のぼけ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:593
msgid "Shadow spread"
msgstr "影の広がり"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:596
msgid "Solid shadow before the falloff starts — what gives it weight"
msgstr "減衰が始まるまでの濃い影 — 重みを出す部分です"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:597
msgid "Shadow offset X"
msgstr "影の位置 X"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:600
msgid "Shadow offset Y"
msgstr "影の位置 Y"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:603
msgid "Crop client shadows"
msgstr "クライアントの影を切り取る"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:606
msgid "Hides the invisible margin apps like Firefox draw their own shadow in"
msgstr "Firefox などが自前の影を描く、見えない余白を隠します"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:608
msgid "Backdrop blur"
msgstr "背景のぼかし"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:609
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "ぼかし"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:612
msgid "Frosts what is behind a translucent window. Opaque ones cost nothing"
msgstr ""
"半透明なウィンドウの背後をすりガラスにします。不透明なものには負荷がかかりま"
"せん"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:613
msgid "Blur passes"
msgstr "ぼかしの回数"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:616
msgid "Blur radius"
msgstr "ぼかしの半径"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:619
msgid "Blur noise"
msgstr "ぼかしのノイズ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:622
msgid "Blur brightness"
msgstr "ぼかしの明るさ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:625
msgid "Blur contrast"
msgstr "ぼかしのコントラスト"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:628
msgid "Blur saturation"
msgstr "ぼかしの彩度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:631
msgid "Blur halo"
msgstr "ぼかしのはみ出し"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:634
msgid "How far the blur reaches past the window. 0 keeps it inside the frame"
msgstr "ぼかしがウィンドウの外へどこまで及ぶか。0 なら枠の内側に収まります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:641
msgid "Window open"
msgstr "ウィンドウを開く"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:642
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "アニメーション"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:645
msgid ""
"How a window arrives. Closing is not animated: the client's buffer is gone "
"the moment it unmaps"
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウの現れ方。閉じる方は動きません: 解除した瞬間にクライアントのバッ"
"ファが消えるためです"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:647
msgid "Window length"
msgstr "ウィンドウの長さ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:650
msgid "0 jumps straight to the end state. Also times the niri strip slide"
msgstr ""
"0 なら最終状態へ直接飛びます。niri のストリップの滑りもこれで決まります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:651
msgid "Rise distance"
msgstr "せり上がる距離"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:654
msgid ""
"How far a Rise window travels up into place. Ignored by the other styles"
msgstr "せり上がるウィンドウがどこまで上へ動くか。他の方式では使われません"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:655
msgid "Desktop switch"
msgstr "デスクトップの切り替え"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:658
msgid ""
"Fade cross-fades the two desks; Slide sends them off the way you switched; "
"Cube turns the desk in 3D"
msgstr ""
"フェードは二つの面を混ぜ、スライドは切り替えた方向へ送り出し、キューブは面を"
"立体的に回します"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:660
msgid "Desktop length"
msgstr "切り替えの長さ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:663
msgid ""
"A slide wants longer than a fade — the eye has to follow it somewhere — and "
"a cube wants longer again; try 400-600"
msgstr ""
"スライドはフェードより長め — 目が追う必要があります — キューブはさらに長め"
"に。400〜600 を目安に"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:665
msgid "Easing"
msgstr "イーサリング"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:668
msgid ""
"Shared by both, and by the strip slide: two easings read as two desktops"
msgstr ""
"両方と、ストリップの滑りに共通です: 曲線が二つあると二つのデスクトップに見え"
"ます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:669
msgid "Desktops span"
msgstr "デスクトップの範囲"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:672
msgid ""
"Shared: one desktop across every monitor. Per-monitor: each screen remembers "
"its own, and the switch moves only the focused one"
msgstr ""
"共通: 全画面で一つのデスクトップ。画面ごと: 各画面が自分の面を覚え、切り替え"
"は選択中の画面だけ動かします"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:678
msgid "Focus follows"
msgstr "フォーカスの追従"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:679
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "挙動"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:682
msgid ""
"Click: only a click focuses. Sloppy and Strict follow the pointer; over the "
"desktop, Strict drops focus, Sloppy keeps it"
msgstr ""
"クリック: クリックのみで移ります。ゆるいと厳密はポインターに従い、デスクトッ"
"プ上では厳密が外し、ゆるいは保ちます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:684
msgid "Focus delay"
msgstr "フォーカスの遅延"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:687
msgid ""
"How long the pointer rests before focus follows it. 0 is instant, which also "
"focuses windows you only crossed over"
msgstr ""
"ポインターが止まってからフォーカスが移るまで。0 は即時で、通り過ぎただけの"
"ウィンドウにも移ります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:689
msgid "Edge snapping"
msgstr "端でのスナップ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:691
msgid "Drag a window to an edge to fill that half or quarter"
msgstr "ウィンドウを端へ運ぶと、その半分または四分の一を埋めます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:692
msgid "Snap zone"
msgstr "スナップの範囲"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:695
msgid ""
"How close to the edge a drag arms the snap. Raise it on a high-DPI panel, or "
"if a fast pointer crosses the band"
msgstr ""
"端からどれだけ近づくとスナップが働くか。高精細な画面や、速いポインターが帯を"
"跳び越すときは上げてください"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:697
msgid "Remember window size"
msgstr "ウィンドウの大きさを覚える"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:699
msgid "Reopen each app where and how big it was when it closed"
msgstr "各アプリを、閉じたときの場所と大きさで開き直します"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:701
msgid "Alt+Tab is mission control"
msgstr "Alt+Tab をミッションコントロールに"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:702
msgid "Alt+Tab"
msgstr "Alt+Tab"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:704
msgid ""
"On, Alt+Tab opens the whole desk. Off, the MRU thumbnail strip — and the "
"three rows below describe that strip"
msgstr ""
"オンなら Alt+Tab で面全体が開きます。オフなら使用順のサムネイル列 — 下の三行"
"はその列の設定です"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:706
msgid "Alt+Tab previews"
msgstr "Alt+Tab のプレビュー"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:708
msgid "The thumbnail grid. Off, Alt+Tab still cycles — silently"
msgstr "サムネイルの並び。オフでも Alt+Tab は切り替わります — 表示なしで"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:709
msgid "Alt+Tab across desktops"
msgstr "Alt+Tab がデスクトップをまたぐ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:711
msgid "Alt+Tab reaches minimized"
msgstr "Alt+Tab が最小化にも届く"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:721
msgid "Panels follow the pointer"
msgstr "パネルがポインターに従う"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:722
msgid "Panels"
msgstr "パネル"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:725
msgid ""
"On, an open panel moves to whichever monitor the pointer is on. Off, it "
"stays on the monitor you opened it on"
msgstr ""
"オンなら開いているパネルがポインターのいる画面へ移ります。オフなら開いた画面"
"にとどまります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:731
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "電卓"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:734
msgid ""
"Window: drag it by the header, click elsewhere freely. Clickoff: closes when "
"you click away. Esc always closes"
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウ: 見出しでつかんで動かし、他は自由にクリック。外側で閉じる: 離れて"
"クリックすると閉じます。Esc は常に閉じます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:736
msgid "Control panel"
msgstr "コントロールパネル"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:739
msgid "How this panel itself behaves"
msgstr "このパネル自体のふるまい"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:740 src/ctlpanel.c:1276
msgid "Task manager"
msgstr "タスクマネージャー"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:743
msgid "How the task manager behaves"
msgstr "タスクマネージャーのふるまい"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:748
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "デスクトップ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:749
msgid "Of the desktop you are on — layout is per-desktop, not global"
msgstr "いま開いている面のもの — 配置は面ごとで、全体ではありません"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:750
msgid "Mission control"
msgstr "ミッションコントロール"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:751
msgid "Every window on this desktop at once, and the desktops themselves"
msgstr "この面のすべてのウィンドウと、デスクトップそのもの"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:752
msgid "Desktop icons"
msgstr "デスクトップのアイコン"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:754
msgid "Draw ~/Desktop on the wallpaper"
msgstr "~/Desktop を壁紙の上に描きます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:755
msgid "Icon order"
msgstr "アイコンの並び"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:758
msgid "Desktop widgets"
msgstr "デスクトップのウィジェット"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:769
msgid "Widget glass"
msgstr "ウィジェットのガラス"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:772
msgid "Desktop widgets take the dock's glass instead of the HUD panel"
msgstr "ウィジェットは HUD パネルではなくドックのガラスに従います"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:774 src/ctlpanel.c:775
msgid "Dock"
msgstr "ドック"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:776
msgid "Dock auto-hide"
msgstr "ドックを自動で隠す"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:780
msgid "Dock above windows"
msgstr "ドックをウィンドウより前に"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:781
msgid ""
"Off, windows cover a pinned dock. Auto-hide always arrives on top — it is "
"summoned over whatever is there"
msgstr ""
"オフなら固定したドックはウィンドウに隠れます。自動で隠れる方は常に前面 — 何が"
"あってもその上に呼び出されます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:783
msgid "Dock edge"
msgstr "ドックの位置"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:786
msgid "Dock size"
msgstr "ドックの大きさ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:792
msgid "The slab AND the icons in it — the icons are this minus 16"
msgstr "台とその中のアイコンの両方 — アイコンはこれから 16 を引いた値です"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:793
msgid "Dock reveal strip"
msgstr "ドックを呼び出す帯"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:796
msgid "How close to the edge the pointer must get to bring it back"
msgstr "ポインターが端にどれだけ近づけば戻ってくるか"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:797
msgid "Dock magnify"
msgstr "ドックの拡大"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:798
msgid "The icons under the pointer swell and the row slides apart to make room"
msgstr "ポインターの下のアイコンが膨らみ、列が左右に開いて場所を作ります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:806
msgid "Dock magnify amount"
msgstr "拡大の大きさ"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:813
msgid ""
"How big the icon under the pointer gets. The dock makes room for it, so a "
"big swell is a taller dock"
msgstr ""
"ポインターの下のアイコンがどこまで大きくなるか。ドックが場所を空けるので、大"
"きく膨らむほどドックも高くなります"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:822
msgid "Dock style"
msgstr "ドックの様式"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:823
msgid "Dock look"
msgstr "ドックの見た目"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:826
msgid "Glass frosts the wallpaper behind the bar. Auto follows the theme"
msgstr "ガラスはバーの背後の壁紙をすりガラスにします。自動はテーマに従います"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:827
msgid "Dock opacity"
msgstr "ドックの不透明度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:841
msgid "0.00 leaves the icons alone on the wallpaper; 1.00 hides it completely"
msgstr "0.00 なら壁紙の上にアイコンだけが残り、1.00 なら完全に隠れます"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:843
msgid "Dock corners"
msgstr "ドックの角"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:849
msgid "Its own, not the window radius. Caps at half the dock's size"
msgstr ""
"ドック専用で、ウィンドウの丸みとは別です。ドックの大きさの半分が上限です"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:851
msgid "Show all apps button"
msgstr "すべてのアプリのボタン"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:852
